  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Biblioteksst&#xF6;det syftar till att:   - ge universitetsbibliotek p&#xE5; Sri Lanka tillg&#xE5;ng till vetenskapliga tidskrifter elektroniskt   - etablera en Sri Lanka Journal On-line  - utbilda bibliotekarier p&#xE5; Sri Lanka i elektronisk data hantering</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Library support aims to, among other things:  - Give access to e-information;  - Establish the Sri Lankan Journal On-Line;  - Journal On-Line loading and management workshops for university librarians from all of Sri Lanka;   - Training on proposal writing.</narrative>
  </description>
